title:        Reference render of composition hdr-03-max (frame at 0.5 s, 320 x 180, 16 bit RGBA) as After Effects 2026 draws it
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       rendered by Adobe After Effects 2026 (26.2.1x2) on Windows 11 with saveFrameToPng from composition hdr-03-max of aep/1100-quickwins.aep and aep/1110-extra.aep (tools/aep/importer-samples/jsx/lib.jsx; docs/aep/2026-11-05-importer-samples.md)
