notes:        Reference output of the application, not of EffectCraft: the expected look of the variant for later render comparisons. The file contains only the IHDR, IDAT and IEND chunks (no colour profile, text, time stamp or other metadata chunk). The same composition name exists in 1100-quickwins and 1110-extra; the file kept here is the later run (1110-extra).
